    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d663">

                <pb facs="0789" n="693" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg693"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Storer.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 24.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith copy of a communication
                    from Mr. Gonzalo de Quesada, special commissioner of Cuba to the United States,
                    transmitting a list of Cuban political prisoners held by Spain.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to bring the matter to the attention of the Spanish
                    Government, and to ask for a compliance with the provisions of article 6 of the
                    treaty of peace in this and all similar cases.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Hay.</hi></signed></closer>





